Package: ProteoAnalystR
Type: Package
Title: Backend R Functions for the ProteoAnalyst Platform
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Jeff", "Xia", email = "jeff.xia@mcgill.ca", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Guangyan", "Zhou", email = "guangyan.zhou@mail.mcgill.ca", role = "aut"))
Description: The statistical and visualization backend that powers the ProteoAnalyst
    web platform for downstream analysis of quantitative proteomics and
    phosphoproteomics data. Provides readers for common upstream outputs (MaxQuant,
    FragPipe, DIA-NN, Spectronaut, and MSstats/MSstatsPTM long tables), normalization,
    peptide-to-protein summarization, imputation, differential expression (limma /
    DEqMS / edgeR / DESeq2), protein-adjusted PTM/occupancy analysis, functional and
    kinase enrichment, WGCNA/co-expression, PPI network construction, and biomarker /
    ROC analysis.
